% DRAFT-PR-LATE (source monorepo issue #376): a harness run whose work stayed
% invisible to the operator, with no draft pull request, for longer than the
% measured knee. extract.ml writes the base relations from the run's event
% log; the contract adds knee(K) for each candidate it tries.

/* facts
   universe   R: harness runs (assignment identifiers); S, K: seconds
   relation   run ⊆ R; gated ⊆ R; opened ⊆ R × S
   relation   score ⊆ R × S: seconds from the run's start to its first draft pull request, or to its last event when it opened none
*/

/* predicate invisible
   universe   R: harness runs whose tool calls went through the session gate
   relation   score : R → ℕ; κ ∈ ℕ, the knee
   clause     ∀r ∈ R. score(r) ≤ κ
   finding    invisible = {r ∈ R | score(r) > κ}
*/
invisible(R) :- gated(R), score(R, S), knee(K), gt(S, K).
